=== layout: two-plus-one-panels


@top-left

![Slide image 3](assets/lect05e-probability_problems/image_002.png)

@bottom-left

![Slide image 3](assets/lect05e-probability_problems/image_003.png)

@right

- We want the probability the F2 seed genotype is heterozygous given the F2 seed was round.
- Written as\:
  - P(hetero | round)

=== layout: two-plus-one-panels


@top-left

![Slide image 3](assets/lect05e-probability_problems/image_002.png)

@bottom-left

![Slide image 3](assets/lect05e-probability_problems/image_003.png)

@right

- We want the [probability the genotype is heterozygous given the seed is round]{color=red}.
- [P(hetero | round)]{color=red}
  - [This]{color=red} is equal to the [probability that the seed is both heterozygous and round]{color=orange} divided by the [probability the seed is round (with any genotype)]{color=gray}
- [P(hetero | round)]{color=red}
  - = [P(hetero and round)]{color=orange} ÷ [P(round)]{color=gray}

=== layout: two-plus-one-panels


@top-left

![Slide image 3](assets/lect05e-probability_problems/image_002.png)

@bottom-left

![Slide image 3](assets/lect05e-probability_problems/image_003.png)

@right

- [Goal\:]{color=red}
  - [P(hetero | round)]{color=red}
- [P(hetero | round)]{color=red}
  - = [P(hetero and round)]{color=orange} ÷ [P(round)]{color=gray}
- [P(round) = ¾]{color=gray}
- [P(hetero) = 2 out of 4 = ½]{color=green}
- [P(round|hetero) = 1]{color=green}
- [P(round and hetero)]{color=orange}
  - [= P(hetero)]{color=green} [&times;]{color=orange} [P(round|hetero)]{color=green}
  - = [½]{color=green} [&times;]{color=orange} [1]{color=green} = [½]{color=orange}

=== layout: two-plus-one-panels


@top-left

![Slide image 3](assets/lect05e-probability_problems/image_002.png)

@bottom-left

![Slide image 3](assets/lect05e-probability_problems/image_003.png)

@right

- [Goal\:]{color=red}
  - [P(hetero | round)]{color=red}
- [P(round) = ¾]{color=gray}
- [P(round and hetero) = ½]{color=orange}
- [P(hetero | round)]{color=red}
  - [= ]{color=red}[P(hetero and round)]{color=orange} ÷ [P(round)]{color=gray}
  - [= ½ ÷ ¾]{color=red}
  - [= 4/6 = 2/3]{color=red}

